   "text": "That was the simulation — this is your coach. You acknowledged the frustration early and stayed with the policy twice when I pushed — that's exactly what holding the line looks like. The one soft spot: when I pushed the second time, explaining why the policy exists — 'the supervisor guardrail exists so large refunds get a second set of eyes' — lands better than repeating the rule. Strong call."
